  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d7ea898f0605b46b3aa06c5dd60dfb1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Blood Ledger page
  Body: 'BLOOD LEDGER, THE MARGRAVE''S OWN HAND


    First night: the cellarer.
    Second night: the cook and both her girls. The bargain asked for the household
    one name at a time, and I wrote each name myself because he asked me to.


    The
    candles lean when he is near. They lean toward the thing that wants us.'
